\begin_deeper
\begin_layout Itemize
Global autoregressive vector (GVAR) methodology was made by Pesaran, Weiner
 and Schuermann (2004), and improved on by Dees, Mauro, Pesaran and Smith
 (2007);
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Chudik and Pesaran (2011) - Analyzed the curse of dimensionality in the
 case of large dynamic linear systems.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Infinite-dimensional VAR could be well approximated by a set of finite dimension
al small-scale models that can be consistently estimated separately.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Spatial analysis application is a natural option of this framework;
\end_layout

\end_deeper
\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Separator parbreak
\end_inset


\end_layout

